"A rollup is one app, one hostname and one IP address added up over the window, at the same minute granularity Reports uses — never per connection and never per packet. Rollups go about two minutes behind, once the minute they belong to is complete; alerts go as they are raised. A collector that can't be reached is retried with a growing delay, and at most 10,000 records are held while it's down." = "一筆彙總資料是一個 App、一個主機名稱和一個 IP 位址在該時間範圍內的累加，精細度與「報告」相同，以分鐘為單位 — 絕不是逐條連線，也絕不是逐個封包。彙總資料大約延後兩分鐘送出，等它所屬的那一分鐘結束之後；警示則在發出時立即送出。連不上的收集器會以逐漸拉長的間隔重試，在它無法連線期間，最多保留 10,000 筆記錄。";
"Every field that can leave this Mac (%lld)" = "所有可能離開這台 Mac 的欄位（%lld）";
"That list is the whole of it — it is generated from the same declaration the payload is built from, so it can't fall behind the code. Never sent, in any format and whatever else is switched on: anything HTTPS inspection records. Request and response headers, bodies, tool calls and the contents of any decrypted exchange have no path into an export." = "這份清單就是全部 — 它是由建立傳送內容所用的同一份宣告產生的，所以不會落後於程式碼。無論格式為何、無論還開啟了什麼，以下內容一律不會送出：HTTPS 檢查記錄的任何東西。請求與回應的標頭、內文、工具呼叫，以及任何解密後交換的內容，都沒有任何管道進入匯出資料。";
