"The preview is built from your own traffic and is never sent. Test connection sends the smallest thing the format allows — an OpenTelemetry request with no records in it, or one line marked as a test — and reports what the collector actually answered." = "預覽是用你自己的流量建立的，而且絕不會送出。「測試連線」會送出該格式允許的最小內容 — 一個沒有任何記錄的 OpenTelemetry 請求，或一行標示為測試的資料 — 然後回報收集器實際的回應。";
