"A program reads its proxy settings once, when it starts, so there is no way to route one that is already running. %@ is asked to quit — an unsaved document will refuse, and nothing is discarded — and started again with its HTTPS pointed at Flowlight." = "程式只在啟動時讀取一次代理伺服器設定，所以沒辦法讓已經在執行的程式改走代理伺服器。Flowlight 會要求 %@ 結束 — 有未儲存的文件時它會拒絕結束，不會丟掉任何內容 — 再把它的 HTTPS 指向 Flowlight 重新啟動。";
