/* UI/CaptureView.swift */
"Delete all recorded traffic, baselines and alerts?" = "要刪除所有已記錄的流量、基線和警示嗎？";
"Delete everything" = "全部刪除";
"nettop sampler · the extension didn't answer" = "nettop 取樣器 · 延伸功能沒有回應";
"%@ · receiving" = "%@ · 正在接收";
"%@ · nothing arriving yet" = "%@ · 還沒有資料傳入";
"Source" = "來源";
"Content filter" = "內容過濾器";
"Observes eligible TCP and UDP flows as they open. Requires the Network Extension entitlement and your approval." = "在符合條件的 TCP 和 UDP 流量建立時就觀察它們。需要網路延伸功能的權利，以及你的允許。";
"Samples nettop once per second without a separate entitlement. Connections that begin and end between samples may not be recorded." = "每秒讀取 nettop 一次，不需要另外的權利。在兩次取樣之間開始又結束的連線可能不會被記錄。";
"Arriving from nettop, not the extension" = "資料來自 nettop，而不是延伸功能";
"Data is arriving" = "資料正在傳入";
"Nothing is arriving" = "沒有資料傳入";
"Flowlight couldn't reach the filter extension and is sampling with nettop so you still get data. Your chosen source is still the extension." = "Flowlight 無法連接過濾器延伸功能，因此改用 nettop 取樣，讓你仍然有資料可看。你選擇的來源仍然是延伸功能。";
"Install & Enable Filter" = "安裝並啟用過濾器";
"Disable Filter" = "停用過濾器";
"Uninstall" = "解除安裝";
"Refresh" = "重新整理";
"Re-check the filter and reconnect to it" = "重新檢查過濾器並重新連接";
"Try the Extension Again" = "再試一次延伸功能";
"Stop sampling with nettop and reconnect to the filter extension" = "停止用 nettop 取樣，並重新連接過濾器延伸功能";
"entitled" = "已取得權利";
"not entitled" = "未取得權利";
"in /Applications" = "位於 /Applications";
"not in /Applications" = "不在 /Applications";
"The content filter (NEFilterDataProvider) attributes eligible TCP and UDP flows to their source apps via audit tokens, extracts TLS SNI, HTTP Host and DNS answers, and sends one-second summaries to this app over XPC. It requires the Network Extension entitlement (content-filter-provider-systemextension) on a paid developer team, and the app must be in the Applications folder. It only refuses a connection where a rule says to; with no enforcing rule it reports and nothing else." = "內容過濾器（NEFilterDataProvider）會透過 audit token 把符合條件的 TCP 和 UDP 流量歸給來源 App，取出 TLS SNI、HTTP Host 和 DNS 回應，並透過 XPC 把每秒的摘要送給這個 App。它需要付費開發者團隊的網路延伸功能權利（content-filter-provider-systemextension），而且 App 必須放在「應用程式」檔案夾中。它只會在規則指示時拒絕連線；在沒有任何規則需要執行時，它只會記錄下來，不做別的事。";
"Captures short-lived eligible flows" = "能擷取短暫的符合條件流量";
"macOS calls the filter when an eligible connection opens, providing better coverage of short requests than periodic sampling. Traffic from before activation is not available, some system traffic is exempt from content filters, and byte counts come from the filter's statistics reports." = "當符合條件的連線建立時，macOS 會呼叫過濾器，因此對短促的請求比定期取樣涵蓋得更完整。啟用之前的流量無法取得，部分系統流量不受內容過濾器約束，而位元組計數來自過濾器的統計報告。";
"It keeps filtering after you quit Flowlight" = "結束 Flowlight 之後它仍會繼續過濾";
"The system extension runs independently and remains active until you select Disable or Uninstall. While the Flowlight app is closed, summaries are buffered by the extension for later delivery, subject to its retention limit." = "系統延伸功能獨立執行，並持續作用，直到你選擇「停用」或「解除安裝」。Flowlight App 關閉期間，摘要會由延伸功能暫存起來稍後送出，並受其保留上限限制。";
"macOS runs one content filter at a time" = "macOS 一次只執行一個內容過濾器";
"If a VPN or security agent already has that slot — Palo Alto Networks GlobalProtect, CrowdStrike Falcon and similar all use it — Flowlight's filter installs and connects but is never asked to filter anything, so nothing appears. Use the sampler on those Macs." = "如果 VPN 或安全代理程式已經占用那個位置 — Palo Alto Networks GlobalProtect、CrowdStrike Falcon 這類軟體都會用它 — Flowlight 的過濾器可以安裝並連接，但永遠不會被要求過濾任何東西，所以什麼都不會出現。在那樣的 Mac 上請使用取樣器。";
"Flowlight reads /usr/bin/nettop once per second. You get per-process, per-connection byte counts with no entitlements, and protocols from port heuristics." = "Flowlight 每秒讀取 /usr/bin/nettop 一次。不需要任何權利就能得到各程序、各連線的位元組計數，協定則由連接埠推斷。";
"What it misses is whole connections, not bytes" = "它漏掉的是整條連線，而不是位元組";
"nettop reports running totals, and Flowlight records the difference between one second and the next — so a long transfer is counted exactly, however bursty it was. What never appears is anything that starts and finishes between two readings: a quick DNS lookup, a fast API call, a script that runs curl and exits. The extension sees those." = "nettop 回報的是累計總量，而 Flowlight 記錄的是前後兩秒之間的差值 — 所以長時間的傳輸無論多不平均都會被精確計算。永遠不會出現的，是在兩次讀取之間開始又結束的東西：一次快速的 DNS 查詢、一次很快的 API 呼叫、一個執行 curl 後就結束的指令檔。這些延伸功能看得到。";
"Storage" = "儲存";
"Database" = "資料庫";
"Reveal in Finder" = "在 Finder 中顯示";
"Clear All Data…" = "清除所有資料…";
"Hostnames" = "主機名稱";
"Named" = "已命名";
"Named or owner known" = "已命名或已知擁有者";
"Of the connections seen in the last hour. Order of preference: TLS server name, DNS answer, reverse DNS, network owner." = "以過去一小時內看到的連線為準。判定順序：TLS 伺服器名稱、DNS 回應、反向 DNS、網路擁有者。";
"Learn hostnames from DNS and TLS" = "從 DNS 和 TLS 學習主機名稱";
"Reads DNS answers and TLS server names (SNI) on the primary network interface. Packet contents are not stored." = "讀取主要網路介面上的 DNS 回應和 TLS 伺服器名稱（SNI）。不會儲存封包內容。";
"Remove Access…" = "移除存取權…";
"Setup is installed, but this login session doesn't have access yet. Log out and back in, or restart your Mac." = "設定已安裝，但這次登入的工作階段還沒有存取權。請登出再登入，或重新啟動你的 Mac。";
"macOS only lets administrators read network packets. A one-time setup grants your account read access, as Wireshark does. It asks for your password once." = "macOS 只允許管理者讀取網路封包。一次性的設定會授予你的帳號讀取權，就像 Wireshark 那樣。它會要求輸入一次密碼。";
"Run Setup Again…" = "再次執行設定…";
"Enable Packet Capture…" = "啟用封包擷取…";
"Identify network owners" = "辨識網路擁有者";
"When no hostname is known, look up who operates the IP (e.g. Cloudflare, Google) using Team Cymru's DNS service. Public IPs are sent to that service; private addresses never are." = "在沒有已知主機名稱時，使用 Team Cymru 的 DNS 服務查詢這個 IP 由誰營運（例如 Cloudflare、Google）。公開 IP 會送到該服務；私有位址一律不會。";
"Capturing on %@ · %@ hostnames learned this session" = "正在 %@ 上擷取 · 本次工作階段學到 %@ 個主機名稱";
"Needs one-time setup" = "需要一次性設定";
"Stopped" = "已停止";
"See which sites your apps talk to" = "查看你的 App 連線哪些網站";
"Without this, most traffic shows only an IP address or network owner." = "沒有這項功能，大部分流量只會顯示 IP 位址或網路擁有者。";
"Flowlight reads DNS answers and TLS server names on your primary network interface to name connections." = "Flowlight 會讀取你主要網路介面上的 DNS 回應和 TLS 伺服器名稱，用來為連線命名。";
"Packet contents are never stored or sent anywhere. Only hostnames are kept." = "封包內容一律不會儲存，也不會送到任何地方。只保留主機名稱。";
"macOS only lets administrators read packets, so this asks for your password once. You can remove it any time in Capture." = "macOS 只允許管理者讀取封包，所以這會要求輸入一次密碼。你隨時可以在「擷取」中移除它。";
"Identify network owners when no hostname is available" = "沒有主機名稱時，辨識網路擁有者";
"On by default. Sends public destination IPs to Team Cymru's DNS service. Turn off to keep these lookups on your Mac." = "預設開啟。會把公開的目標 IP 傳送到 Team Cymru 的 DNS 服務。關閉後，這些查詢只會在你的 Mac 上進行。";
"Not Now" = "現在不要";
"Enable Hostnames…" = "啟用主機名稱…";

/* UI/CaptureWarning.swift */
"The Network Extension can't capture on this Mac" = "網路延伸功能無法在這台 Mac 上擷取";
