"Blocking needs the Network Extension" = "封鎖需要網路延伸功能";
"Use the Network Extension" = "使用網路延伸功能";
"This build isn't signed for the Network Extension, so nothing sits in the path of a connection to refuse it. Allowlists still raise alerts." = "這個版本沒有為網路延伸功能簽署，所以沒有任何東西位在連線的路徑上可以拒絕它。允許清單仍然會發出警示。";
