"macOS runs one content filter at a time. While these are active, Flowlight's filter can install and connect but will never be handed any traffic — the Network Extension source will stay empty. The nettop sampler doesn't use a filter and works alongside them." = "macOS 一次只執行一個內容過濾器。當這些正在運作時，Flowlight 的過濾器可以安裝並連接，但永遠不會拿到任何流量 — 網路延伸功能這個來源會一直是空的。nettop 取樣器不使用過濾器，可以與它們並存。";

