"What an app sent is readable only where the app was routed through the proxy. Anything else is counted and named, but its contents were never offered to Flowlight." = "App 送出的內容，只有在該 App 經過代理伺服器時才讀得到。其餘的都有計數、也有名稱，但內容從來沒有交給 Flowlight。";
