"By app" = "依 App";
"Share of this app's bytes whose destination has a hostname rather than a bare address." = "這個 App 的位元組中，目的地有主機名稱（而不是只有一個位址）的比例。";
"%@ of its bytes went to addresses with no hostname" = "這個 App 有 %@ 的位元組送到了沒有主機名稱的位址";
"nothing of its traffic reached the proxy, so no contents were read" = "它的流量沒有任何一部分到達代理伺服器，所以沒有讀到任何內容";
